buffer's slots are zeros (or uninitialised), which carry nothing, so its entry
in memory's holding is `.zero`, and the handle binds carrying nothing. -/
theorem tstepMR_newBuf {Sp : AllocLabel → List Res} {p : Prog} {g : G} {mem : Memory} {pairs : List Ts} {th : TTh}
    {cx : Cx} {ρ : Nat → Nat} {η : TEnv} {x : String} {n : At} {τ : Ty} {e : Expr}
